    IDS_CONFIRM_HEADING              "Change to Windows"
    IDS_ABOUT_HEADING                "About WSA-Next"
    IDS_ABOUT_TEXT                   "{0} {1}\nWindows Subsystem for Android with Android 15, built from AOSP, on Microsoft's WSA 2407 platform.\n\n{2}\nhttps://github.com/{3}\n\nAndroid is a trademark of Google LLC. Windows Subsystem for Android is a product of Microsoft Corporation; WSA-Next is not affiliated with either."
    IDS_CLI_HEADING                  "Command line"
    IDS_FOLDER_PICK                  "Install folder for WSA-Next"
    IDS_DONE_HEADING                 "WSA-Next is installed"
    IDS_RESTART_HEADING              "Restart needed"
    IDS_RESTART_OK                   "Restart now"
    IDS_HELP_MESSAGE                 "{} also runs from a command prompt or a script. The command line is always English, so its output can be parsed."
    IDS_UNINSTALL_HEADING            "Uninstall WSA-Next"
    IDS_UNINSTALL_MESSAGE            "Keep Android data: WSA-Next and its files in {0} are removed. Your Android apps, accounts and files ({1}) stay in your user profile and are back when you install WSA-Next again.\n\nRemove everything: also deletes the Android data, the Start menu entries of Android apps, their file associations and notification settings, the Bluetooth bridge and the settings of WSA-Next. Developer mode and Virtual Machine Platform are turned off again if WSA-Next turned them on."
    IDS_UNINSTALL_KEEP               "Keep Android data"
    IDS_UNINSTALL_ALL                "Remove everything"
    IDS_UNINSTALL_ALL_HEADING        "Delete all Android data?"
    IDS_UNINSTALL_ALL_MESSAGE        "Your Android apps, their data, your Google account sign-in and the files stored in Android ({}) will be deleted. This cannot be undone."
    IDS_UNINSTALL_ALL_OK             "Delete everything"

    IDS_ELEVATION_HEADING            "Root for Android apps"
    IDS_ELEVATION_TEXT               "Android apps will be able to ask for root rights with the command 0 - root is uid 0 - (for example from Termux). Every request shows Windows Hello on this PC with the app and the command: nothing runs as root without your fingerprint, face or PIN.\n\nConfirm only apps you trust: root can read and change everything in Android. The Android images stay unchanged (no Magisk)."
    IDS_ELEVATION_OK                 "Turn on"
    IDS_HELLO_REMEMBER_HEADING       "Remember Windows Hello"
    IDS_HELLO_REMEMBER_TEXT          "After you confirm with Windows Hello once, Android apps that ask for your fingerprint (a bank or a broker, for example) get in without asking again for the time you chose. Anyone using this PC meanwhile gets in too.\n\nLocking Windows (Win+L), sleep with a sign-in and signing out always end it. Root for Android apps (0) still asks every time.\n\nTurn it on only if you accept that, at your own responsibility."
    IDS_HELLO_REMEMBER_OK            "Remember"
